---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectNav from '../components/ProjectNav.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Ndako Tech, Laije Belthassar BALONG"
  description="Projet d'équipe : Lead Business Analyst d'une squad de 9 sur Ndako Tech, du Business Case à la recette. 15 exigences, 32 user stories, 34 cas de recette, décision défavorable."
  active="projets"
>

<p style="margin: 40px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5B6160"><a href="/projets" class="lnk">Projets</a><span aria-hidden="true" style="margin: 0 10px">/</span>Ndako Tech</p>

<section style="padding: 32px 0 56px">
<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Recueil du besoin</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Exigences</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Recette</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E; font-size: 13px">Immobilier</span>
</p>
<h1 style="margin: 24px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.03em">Ndako Tech</h1>
<p style="margin: 24px 0 0; max-width: 60ch; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A504E">Une plateforme pour trouver, vérifier et contacter un logement à distance à Brazzaville et Pointe-Noire, sans passer par un démarcheur. J'ai porté la partie analyse métier, du Business Case à la recette.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 40px 0 0; padding: 0">
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="15" rx="1.8" fill="#E2ECE5"></rect><path d="M4 10h16M9 3v4M15 3v4"></path><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="3" height="3" rx=".7" fill="#3F6B57" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Date</span><span style="display: block; font-weight: 500">Octobre 2026, sprint d'une semaine</span></span>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="2.6" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><circle cx="5.5" cy="10" r="2" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="10" r="2" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><path d="M2.5 18.5c0-1.7 1.3-3 3-3M21.5 18.5c0-1.7-1.3-3-3-3"></path><path d="M8 19.5c0-2.2 1.8-4 4-4s4 1.8 4 4" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Équipe</span><span style="display: block; font-weight: 500">Squad de 9 : PM, 2 BA, 6 développeurs</span></span>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9.5" cy="8" r="3" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><path d="M3.5 19.5c0-3.3 2.7-5.5 6-5.5 1.3 0 2.5.3 3.5.9"></path><path d="M16 20.5v-7h4.5l-1.2 1.75 1.2 1.75H16" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Rôle</span><span style="display: block; font-weight: 500">Lead Business Analyst</span></span>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13.5v5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 18.5v-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 6h5" fill="#E2ECE5"></path><path d="M14 4h6v6M20 4l-8.5 8.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Site livré</span><a href="https://ndakotech.onrender.com" style="display: block; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 15px">ndakotech.onrender.com</a></span>
</li>
</ul>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 32px">
<a href="#livrables" class="btn btn-main" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 50px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 999px; background: #3F6B57; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px">Voir les livrables</a>
<a href="https://ndakotech.onrender.com" class="btn btn-line" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 50px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; color: #17191A; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px">Voir le site</a>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-label="Chiffres clés" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 88px">
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">15</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">exigences, dont 3 non fonctionnelles</p></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">32</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">user stories avec critères d'acceptation</p></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">34</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">cas de recette joués sur le site livré</p></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">6</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">anomalies relevées, dont 2 bloquantes</p></div>
</section>

<section style="padding-bottom: 88px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Le problème</h2>
<p style="margin: 12px 0 0; color: #4A504E">À Brazzaville et Pointe-Noire, chercher un logement à louer passe presque toujours par un démarcheur. Chaque étape de ce circuit coûte au locataire.</p>
</div>
<figure style="flex: 2 1 480px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">Pour un loyer de 100 000 FCFA, avant même d'entrer</p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">300 000 FCFA <span style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 18px; color: #4A504E; letter-spacing: 0">à réunir</span></p>
<div role="img" aria-label="Commission du démarcheur 100 000 FCFA, caution du propriétaire 200 000 FCFA" style="display: flex; gap: 4px; height: 44px; margin-top: 20px">
<span style="flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: #8A5A44; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Commission</span>
<span style="flex: 2; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: #E2ECE5; color: #17191A; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500">Caution</span>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-top: 8px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">
<span style="flex: 1; padding-left: 14px">100 000, au démarcheur</span>
<span style="flex: 2; padding-left: 14px">200 000, au propriétaire</span>
</div>
<figcaption style="margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #E3E5E1; font-size: 14px; color: #4A504E">S'ajoutent environ 5 000 FCFA par visite, payés même quand le logement ne convient pas. Ce total correspond au budget mobilisable moyen de la cible.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px">
<article style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3.5 8.5a2 2 0 0 0 2-2h13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2h-13a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z" fill="#E2ECE5"></path><path d="M14.5 7v10" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.2"></path><path d="M7.5 12h3.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 16px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 19px">Des visites payées à perte</h3>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Le démarcheur facture chaque visite, même pour un bien qui ne convient pas.</p>
</article>
<article style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5L12 4.5z" fill="#E2ECE5" stroke="none"></path><path d="M3.5 11L12 4.5l8.5 6.5M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5"></path><path d="M10.3 12.6a1.8 1.8 0 1 1 2.5 1.7c-.5.2-.8.6-.8 1.1v.3M12 18h.01" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 16px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 19px">Des annonces douteuses</h3>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Prix opaques, informations fausses ou périmées, biens déjà loués qu'on fait encore visiter.</p>
</article>
<article style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 18h7a3 3 0 0 0 0-6H9a3 3 0 0 1 0-6h7" stroke-dasharray="2 2.4"></path><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2.2" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.2" fill="#3F6B57" stroke="#3F6B57"></circle></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 16px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 19px">Des déplacements inutiles</h3>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Sans information fiable à distance, il faut se déplacer pour vérifier chaque bien.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section style="padding-bottom: 88px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">La réponse : la confiance, pas le prix</h2>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 32px; max-width: 64ch; color: #4A504E">Ndako Tech ne se distingue pas par un catalogue de plus. La plateforme vérifie les annonces et organise la mise en relation.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
<article style="padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #F1F4F2">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5L12 4.5z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="none"></path><path d="M3.5 11L12 4.5l8.5 6.5M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5"></path><path d="M9 14.5l2 2 4-4" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px">Des annonces certifiées</h3>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Photos, description, surface et prix sont vérifiés. Le chercheur ne se déplace pas pour rien. Le badge Bien Vérifié le signale.</p>
</article>
<article style="padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #F1F4F2">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="3" width="10" height="18" rx="2" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect><path d="M7.5 17.5h2"></path><path d="M17.5 10.5l3.5 1.4v3c0 2.2-1.5 3.7-3.5 4.3-2-.6-3.5-2.1-3.5-4.3v-3z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px">Un gestionnaire protégé</h3>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Son numéro n'est jamais affiché. Il reçoit des demandes de visite qualifiées au lieu de trente appels non préparés.</p>
</article>
<article style="padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #F1F4F2">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6.5" cy="8" r="2.5" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="8" r="2.5" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><path d="M2.5 18.5c0-2.2 1.8-4 4-4M21.5 18.5c0-2.2-1.8-4-4-4"></path><path d="M9.5 12.5h5M13 11l1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<h3 style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px">Une mise en relation encadrée</h3>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Tant que l'échange reste sur la plateforme, tout a été vérifié au préalable. La demande de visite passe par un compte.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px; padding-bottom: 88px">
<h2 style="flex: 1 1 240px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Mon rôle</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 520px; min-width: 0">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55">Lead Business Analyst d'une squad de 9, j'ai co-rédigé avec Darchina Mabika Ivora, Business Analyst, l'ensemble du dossier d'analyse, à partir du mini-PRD et de la discovery du PM, Divin Bakala.</p>
<ul style="margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<li style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start"><span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3F6B57"></span><span>Business Case, BRD et FRD, du problème aux règles de gestion.</span></li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start"><span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3F6B57"></span><span>User stories avec critères d'acceptation, priorisées en MoSCoW.</span></li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start"><span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3F6B57"></span><span>Matrice de traçabilité, de l'objectif métier au cas de recette.</span></li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start"><span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3F6B57"></span><span>Cahier de recette, joué sur le site livré, et décision de recette.</span></li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start"><span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3F6B57"></span><span>Présentation de la partie analyse métier devant le jury.</span></li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">Le site a été développé par les six développeurs de la squad.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section style="padding-bottom: 88px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Une chaîne tracée de bout en bout</h2>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 32px; max-width: 64ch; color: #4A504E">Chaque objectif métier descend jusqu'à un cas de recette. Si un test échoue, on sait quel besoin n'est pas couvert.</p>
<ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch; gap: 8px">
<li style="flex: 1 1 120px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1">5</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-weight: 500">Objectifs</p><p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">OM-01 à 05</p></li>
<li style="flex: 1 1 120px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1">7</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-weight: 500">Besoins</p><p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">BR-01 à 07</p></li>
<li style="flex: 1 1 120px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1">15</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-weight: 500">Exigences</p><p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">EX-01 à 17</p></li>
<li style="flex: 1 1 120px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1">32</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-weight: 500">User stories</p><p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">US1 à US34</p></li>
<li style="flex: 1 1 120px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1">11</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-weight: 500">Fonctions</p><p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">F0 à F10</p></li>
<li style="flex: 1 1 120px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #3F6B57; color: #FFFFFF"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1">34</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-weight: 500">Cas de recette</p><p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #CFE0D6">CR-01 à 34</p></li>
</ol>
<p style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160">Les numéros EX-14, EX-16, US32 et US33 ne sont pas utilisés : ils ne sont pas réattribués, pour garder la cohérence entre les documents.</p>

<div style="margin-top: 24px; padding: 28px; border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-weight: 600"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="13" r="7.5" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><circle cx="11" cy="13" r="3.5" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><path d="M11 13l8.5-8.5M16 4.5h3.5V8" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>Exemple : ce que la traçabilité a permis de voir</p>
